{"case_id": "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q39", "domain": "health", "question": "命主身体状况为何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主癸水生于未月，土旺水弱，且月柱、时柱均为土（未、己未），土重克水，日主身弱。年柱庚戌，庚金生水但戌土亦克水，整体水势受制。地支卯木为食神，但被未土所耗，木气不旺。时柱己未七杀攻身，土重水滞，易有泌尿、肾脏或体液循环方面的问题。日主癸水弱而受克，且无强根（仅卯木中藏乙木，非水根），体质先天偏弱，易有暗疾潜伏。结合选项，A选项“从小患有暗疾，影响终身”最符合土重水弱、七杀贴身且无解救的格局特征。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q39", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_1_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 2784, "response_id": "5d0e0171-5075-4442-8672-f4252701e13b", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 227, "completion_tokens": 181, "total_tokens": 408, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 99}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
